stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoToken: Install
    NoToken --> SigningIn: Click Sign In
    SigningIn --> HasToken: SSO Complete
    HasToken --> Refreshing: Every 50min
    Refreshing --> HasToken: Silent refresh
    HasToken --> Expired: 30 days inactive
    Expired --> SigningIn: Re-authenticate
    HasToken --> NoToken: Sign out
